# The build context is the repo root (see the header of each services/*/Dockerfile),
# so without this the host's node_modules — hundreds of MB, and the wrong
# architecture's binaries — is uploaded to the daemon on every build.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output. The builder stage produces its own; a stale copy from the host
# would be shadowed at best and copied over the fresh one at worst.
**/dist
**/.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github

# Local secrets must never reach an image layer.
.env
.env.*

docs
# MCP reads its tool catalogue from this file at boot and disables itself
# without it, so the one document that is runtime input escapes the exclusion
# above. See services/external-service/src/mcp/mcp-tools.ts.
!docs/openapi/external-tools.json
coverage
artifacts
